  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PSG+ Building Strategic Capacity 2017-2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palestine Strategy Group (PSG) has proven to be a strategic thinking platform able to introduce new concepts, options and alternative paradigms to the Pal. political arena. 
Oxford Research Group (ORG) has in-debth knowledge on the Pal/Isr conflict and has developed a unique methodology for conflict resolution. They will provide consultancy, training and support, and also carry out administrative tasks.</narrative>
  </description>
